description "Hanharr

A bloodthirsty Wookiee bounty hunter. Driven by rage and lethal trap-laying, he is a force of pure physical destruction.

^2Weaponry:
- Wookiee Melee 
- Hanharr's Melee Weapon
-- Red/Staff Style Depending On Choice
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
- Hanharr's Traditional Bowcaster (3)
-- 20%- RoF, 30%+ Damage, 40%+ FP Drain
-- 15% Slower Movement 
-- Cripples On Hit, Mag Reload
- Tripmines (3)
- Detpacks (3)

^8Attributes:
- Strength (3)
- Tracking Darts (8)
- 30% Less Knockback Taken
- Blast Armor
- Melee Resist
- Wookiee Fury (2)
- Barge
- Healing (2)
- Dexterity (1)"
